---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Answer from '../components/Answer.astro';
---
<Base title="Pressure washer adapter matrix" description="A matrix of M22-14, M22-15, 1/4 inch QC, 3/8 inch QC, GHT, and Kärcher clip adapters — what to buy for each mismatch." path="/adapters/">
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Adapters</p>
    <h1>Adapter matrix</h1>
    <Answer>
      Write the fitting you <em>have</em> and the fitting the new part <em>wants</em>. Buy one coupler that names both. Do not stack three mystery Amazon pieces.
    </Answer>
    <p>Read the table as “I have the row, I need the column.” GHT appears only as a reminder: it is the inlet, not a high-pressure partner.</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Have ↓ / need →</th>
          <th>M22-14</th>
          <th>M22-15</th>
          <th>3/8″ QC</th>
          <th>1/4″ QC</th>
          <th>K-clip</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>M22-14</td>
          <td>Direct</td>
          <td>14↔15 coupler</td>
          <td>M22-14 × 3/8″ QC</td>
          <td>Usually via wand, not the hose</td>
          <td>M22-14 × K-clip adapter</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>M22-15</td>
          <td>15↔14 coupler</td>
          <td>Direct</td>
          <td>15→14 then 14 × 3/8″ QC, or a native 15 mm QC adapter</td>
          <td>Via wand</td>
          <td>Rare; measure twice</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>3/8″ QC</td>
          <td>3/8″ QC × M22-14</td>
          <td>3/8″ QC × M22-15</td>
          <td>Direct</td>
          <td>3/8″ to 1/4″ reducer (tips only)</td>
          <td>QC × K-clip</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>1/4″ QC</td>
          <td>Not for hose duty</td>
          <td>Not for hose duty</td>
          <td>Reducer the other way is a trap</td>
          <td>Direct</td>
          <td>No</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>K-clip</td>
          <td>K-clip × M22-14 (common K-series hose upgrade)</td>
          <td>Uncommon</td>
          <td>K-clip × 3/8″ QC</td>
          <td>After a wand conversion</td>
          <td>Direct</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>GHT inlet</td>
          <td colspan="5">Stay on the tap side. Use GHT × NPT only if you are plumbing a pump inlet, never a lance.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <h2>Buy rules</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Brass or stainless for anything that sees pump pressure.</li>
      <li>PSI stamp ≥ machine rating.</li>
      <li>One adapter in the line is fine. Three adapters is a leak hunt.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a href="/m22-to-quick-connect/">M22 → QC walkthrough</a> · <a href="/leaks/">Leak tree</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
